WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.170
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:35.440 --> 01:38.755
[Episode 18]

3
01:42.040 --> 01:43.800
I can't believe it's because of that.

4
01:45.694 --> 01:48.993
The moment he heard the word "Chun," he forgot about everything else.

5
01:52.440 --> 01:57.480
To be honest, I never thought much of your friend.

6
01:57.480 --> 02:00.798
A man like him, consumed by fame and fortune,

7
02:00.798 --> 02:03.596
weighs everything for its worth.

8
02:03.596 --> 02:05.416
He's not our kind at all.

9
02:06.694 --> 02:09.673
Now that his mask has fallen, his true self is finally showing.

10
02:12.014 --> 02:13.774
I've known Wen Ji for years.

11
02:13.774 --> 02:15.494
He is actually a man of feeling.

12
02:15.494 --> 02:18.573
But born into a family of high-ranking officials and wealth,

13
02:18.573 --> 02:20.973
he bears burdens he cannot cast off.

14
02:20.973 --> 02:24.894
Though both are sons of officials, Wen Ji is merely wavering.

15
02:24.894 --> 02:29.181
But some people have already lost their minds.

16
02:30.014 --> 02:32.840
Not all officials are alike.

17
02:32.840 --> 02:35.413
If Liu Wen Ji's father came to Sheng'an,

18
02:35.413 --> 02:39.034
he couldn't kneel his way into Zhang Jun's house, even with gold and silver in hand.

19
02:43.413 --> 02:45.474
Are you trying to seek justice for him?

20
02:47.373 --> 02:48.914
Is it so obvious?

21
02:49.494 --> 02:52.093
While speaking of Liu Wen Ji,

22
02:52.093 --> 02:56.113
you were already plotting to make Zhang Jun suffer, weren't you?

23
02:58.133 --> 03:00.474
Your Highness, that's quite frightening.

24
03:01.813 --> 03:06.314
If you need no help from me, I'll stay out of it.

25
03:07.214 --> 03:09.673
Your Highness, I do! I most certainly do!

26
03:15.133 --> 03:16.243
Your Highness.

27
03:17.093 --> 03:19.971
- Do something for me. - At your command, Your Highness.

28
03:25.960 --> 03:27.080
Yes.

29
03:30.014 --> 03:31.870
Having tea, Cui Hua?

30
03:33.774 --> 03:35.440
You're quite good-looking.

31
03:35.440 --> 03:37.166
I'll seek you out later.

32
03:44.080 --> 03:45.280
Serve the food!

33
03:56.454 --> 03:57.214
[Cuiyun Tower]

34
03:57.214 --> 04:00.853
Sir, be sure to ask for me next time!

35
04:00.853 --> 04:02.334
Of course, of course.

36
04:02.334 --> 04:04.214
Watch this trick! I'll leap onto my horse!

37
04:04.214 --> 04:05.383
Bravo!

38
04:07.054 --> 04:09.026
How brave!

39
04:24.440 --> 04:26.000
Don't go.

40
05:07.974 --> 05:09.174
Are you cold?

41
05:12.013 --> 05:13.434
Let's talk inside.

42
05:14.414 --> 05:15.614
No.

43
05:16.253 --> 05:19.080
I'd rather gaze at the moon here.

44
05:19.080 --> 05:22.373
It's stuffy and pitch-black inside.

45
05:22.373 --> 05:26.423
Some draw a court official's salary, yet begrudge a few candles.

46
05:27.265 --> 05:29.414
Tell me before you come next time,

47
05:29.414 --> 05:30.994
and I'll light a few more.

48
05:31.640 --> 05:34.720
Keep your salary for yourself.

49
05:35.534 --> 05:38.213
I ought to visit less often.

50
05:38.213 --> 05:41.874
Every visit brings either trouble or a headache.

51
05:45.568 --> 05:47.033
Is this about Zhang Jun?

52
05:48.013 --> 05:52.294
Fang Tong followed him for days and made inquiries.

53
05:52.294 --> 05:55.186
Each day, after leaving the Minister's Residence,

54
05:55.186 --> 05:57.373
he heads straight to brothels and taverns.

55
05:57.373 --> 05:59.974
After squandering money on food and drink,

56
05:59.974 --> 06:03.333
he flaunts his way through the streets to go hunting outside the city.

57
06:03.333 --> 06:04.953
He does so every day.

58
06:06.174 --> 06:08.450
Isn't that the way of a wastrel?

59
06:09.174 --> 06:12.473
Since he loves hunting, is he any good at it?

60
06:29.414 --> 06:31.352
Three arrows at once!

61
06:38.262 --> 06:41.560
Zhang Cheng, the Minister of Revenue, was nearly sixty when he had this son.

62
06:41.560 --> 06:42.453
Look ahead.

63
06:42.453 --> 06:46.094
He is a fool, useless in both letters and arms,

64
06:46.094 --> 06:49.320
yet he thrives under his father's protection.

65
06:49.320 --> 06:51.600
His father is also a regular at the Yu residence.

66
06:51.600 --> 06:55.080
He stoops to any indignity to curry favor with Yu Cheng An.

67
06:55.080 --> 07:00.520
That clan can't be brought down by a lowly Editor like you with no backing.

68
07:00.520 --> 07:05.240
Even I, a mere princess in name, can do nothing to him.

69
07:05.934 --> 07:08.253
Who said I'd be the one to bring him down?

70
07:08.253 --> 07:10.534
Sheng'an is like an arena.

71
07:10.534 --> 07:14.616
There's a tiger who can devour a jackal like Zhang Jun.

72
07:21.494 --> 07:24.654
Since Zhang Jun dares to harm others in broad daylight,

73
07:24.654 --> 07:26.400
we shall repay him in kind.

74
07:26.400 --> 07:28.253
An eye for an eye.

75
07:28.253 --> 07:33.234
He shall die in broad daylight, before all eyes.

76
07:35.133 --> 07:40.787
In Sheng'an, only one family has the teeth to kill the Zhangs.

77
07:48.040 --> 07:49.803
What are you doing? Don't you know the rules?

78
07:49.803 --> 07:51.974
Who do you think you are, knocking at the back gate of the Yu residence?

79
07:51.974 --> 07:53.054
I am Yan Shang.

80
07:53.054 --> 07:56.294
Young Master Yu once aided me, and I have come to repay his kindness.

81
07:56.294 --> 07:58.333
Kindly announce my arrival.

82
07:58.333 --> 08:00.520
- You're here for the Young Master? - Yes.

83
08:00.520 --> 08:02.998
- Then come with me. - Thank you.

84
08:02.998 --> 08:04.420
- Wait. - He's just letting him in?

85
08:04.420 --> 08:06.200
- How did he get in? - We've waited half the day!

86
08:06.200 --> 08:08.811
- Why let him in? - Why can't we get in?

87
08:37.894 --> 08:39.094
My benefactor!

88
08:40.414 --> 08:41.614
My benefactor?

89
08:49.480 --> 08:50.966
It's you.

90
08:51.575 --> 08:53.074
What brings you here?

91
08:54.333 --> 08:58.374
Last time at Cuiyun Tower, I lacked the means to host you properly.

92
08:58.374 --> 09:00.333
It has weighed on my mind ever since.

93
09:00.333 --> 09:02.774
I've recently received my appointment and my salary,

94
09:02.774 --> 09:05.534
so I hope you'll honor me with another visit.

95
09:05.534 --> 09:07.294
We can feast to our hearts' content.

96
09:07.294 --> 09:09.653
No, I'm not going. I've had my fill of that place.

97
09:10.654 --> 09:11.854
Then...

98
09:13.374 --> 09:14.573
Greetings, Lord Yu.

99
09:14.573 --> 09:15.773
Father.

100
09:19.733 --> 09:21.193
Yan Shang.

101
09:23.308 --> 09:25.934
How do you two know each other?

102
09:25.934 --> 09:28.973
Yan and I met at Chancellor Liu's residence.

103
09:28.973 --> 09:30.294
Indeed.

104
09:30.294 --> 09:33.392
I happened to meet Young Master Yu at Chancellor Liu's residence.

105
09:33.392 --> 09:36.193
It was a chance encounter, and I was honored to make his acquaintance.

106
09:38.374 --> 09:39.634
How intriguing.

107
09:40.534 --> 09:42.125
You...

108
09:42.125 --> 09:43.851
You are quite an intriguing man.

109
09:47.600 --> 09:52.213
You have Danyang Princess's favor,

110
09:52.213 --> 09:54.680
yet you have access to Chancellor Liu's residence.

111
09:54.680 --> 09:58.774
And now, you've even befriended my son.

112
09:58.774 --> 10:02.840
They say making a living in Sheng'an is no easy feat.

113
10:02.840 --> 10:06.080
Yet you seem to fare rather well.

114
10:08.189 --> 10:09.774
You flatter me, Lord Yu.

115
10:09.774 --> 10:11.560
I am but a commoner.

116
10:11.560 --> 10:12.680
Were it not for you, Lord Yu,

117
10:12.680 --> 10:15.134
I wouldn't hold my post at the Institute of Literary Studies.

118
10:15.134 --> 10:20.114
I'd still be wandering Sheng'an, wasting my life away.

119
10:21.774 --> 10:27.920
Recommending talent to the court is simply my duty as a subject.

120
10:27.920 --> 10:29.280
It's not worth mentioning.

121
10:32.240 --> 10:33.280
Speaking of which,

122
10:33.280 --> 10:39.963
the imperial exams seek men of talent and valor to serve the court.

123
10:41.693 --> 10:45.656
Do you consider yourself a man of talent,

124
10:48.530 --> 10:50.433
or a man of valor?

125
10:54.693 --> 10:56.613
With your patronage, Lord Yu,

126
10:56.613 --> 11:01.474
I might dare call myself a man of modest talent.

127
11:04.400 --> 11:06.686
You are certainly bold.

128
11:08.254 --> 11:10.093
Yet something puzzles me.

129
11:10.093 --> 11:14.093
Don't you scholars pride yourselves on being pure and noble,

130
11:14.093 --> 11:17.812
and refuse to associate with an inner court official like me?

131
11:19.603 --> 11:23.453
A gentleman is dignified but not proud, sociable but not partisan.

132
11:23.453 --> 11:29.054
In peaceful times, I seek to uphold virtue for the people's sake.

133
11:29.054 --> 11:33.673
As for who sits upon the throne, that matters little to me.

134
11:43.414 --> 11:45.093
Good.

135
11:45.093 --> 11:49.014
You are well-read, yet no mere bookworm.

136
11:49.014 --> 11:53.393
You are unlike those pedantic scholars.

137
11:55.520 --> 11:57.070
To be honest,

138
11:58.052 --> 12:01.474
my son is truly unlearned.

139
12:04.134 --> 12:10.160
That boy has long relied on my name to get by at the Bureau of Investigation,

140
12:10.160 --> 12:14.480
yet all he's learned are questionable tricks.

141
12:15.213 --> 12:20.193
From now on, Mister Yan, I hope you will guide him.

142
12:21.254 --> 12:22.440
I dare not presume.

143
12:22.440 --> 12:28.638
At the very least, teach him a few upright and honorable ways.

144
12:30.350 --> 12:32.742
Then I shall rely on you, Yan.

145
12:33.414 --> 12:34.714
You flatter me.

146
12:36.254 --> 12:37.454
All right.

147
12:38.213 --> 12:40.213
I know your intentions now.

148
12:40.213 --> 12:43.134
You two should get closer.

149
12:43.134 --> 12:44.334
Farewell, Father.

150
12:57.014 --> 12:59.634
You truly are an intriguing man.

151
13:07.093 --> 13:09.054
Sorry to have troubled you.

152
13:09.054 --> 13:11.754
It's only a few steps. No trouble at all.

153
13:12.853 --> 13:14.693
Tomorrow, I'll be turned away again.

154
13:14.693 --> 13:16.934
That's the real trouble.

155
13:16.934 --> 13:21.654
So you're going to Chancellor Liu's residence again tomorrow?

156
13:21.654 --> 13:23.093
You call that a visit?

157
13:23.093 --> 13:24.827
I never even see him.

158
13:26.493 --> 13:28.213
That must be tiresome.

159
13:28.213 --> 13:30.330
Lord Yu must have ordered you to do so.

160
13:30.330 --> 13:32.973
That old man never even attends court.

161
13:32.973 --> 13:34.613
How much longer can he live?

162
13:34.613 --> 13:38.213
Father makes me visit and pay him all due respect.

163
13:38.213 --> 13:39.913
It's so pretentious.

164
13:43.613 --> 13:49.433
Do you know why Lord Yu insists you visit Chancellor Liu, despite his constant refusals?

165
13:50.213 --> 13:51.853
Why?

166
13:51.853 --> 13:54.733
Because Chancellor Liu has never actually seen you.

167
13:54.733 --> 13:57.714
So what? Speak plainly.

168
13:59.840 --> 14:01.000
Come.

169
14:04.000 --> 14:08.387
Chancellor Liu is the foremost among scholars, a model for all literati.

170
14:08.387 --> 14:09.840
Lord Yu holds him in high regard.

171
14:09.840 --> 14:14.654
By sending you to seek his guidance, he upholds the Yu family's respect for scholars.

172
14:14.654 --> 14:17.774
It is all for show, a mere gesture.

173
14:17.774 --> 14:22.190
A way to reassure scholars throughout the realm.

174
14:22.810 --> 14:24.613
That makes sense.

175
14:24.613 --> 14:25.813
That makes sense.

176
14:26.534 --> 14:29.613
But if Chancellor Liu never sees you, the show is incomplete.

177
14:29.613 --> 14:32.573
His talk of respecting scholars would be completely groundless.

178
14:32.573 --> 14:35.714
And you'll go on being turned away.

179
14:36.934 --> 14:39.733
If he finally sees me,

180
14:39.733 --> 14:43.031
can I stop visiting him so often to suffer?

181
14:43.840 --> 14:46.693
Father told me to show that old man respect.

182
14:46.693 --> 14:49.663
I can't drag him out.

183
14:50.414 --> 14:53.613
Do you know why Chancellor Liu refuses to see you?

184
14:53.613 --> 14:55.294
He just can't stand me.

185
14:55.294 --> 14:57.453
That is not the reason.

186
14:57.453 --> 15:01.474
Everyone knows the state of affairs at court.

187
15:02.120 --> 15:03.493
Chancellor Liu is a man of great wisdom.

188
15:03.493 --> 15:04.774
How could he fail to see it?

189
15:04.774 --> 15:07.254
But as the foremost among scholars,

190
15:07.254 --> 15:11.030
he cannot very well receive you in your present state.

191
15:13.174 --> 15:14.553
What state?

192
15:16.134 --> 15:19.573
Yu, do you truly wish to meet Chancellor Liu?

193
15:19.573 --> 15:22.294
I do. More than anything.

194
15:22.294 --> 15:26.934
Once I've met him, I'll have finished the task Father gave me.

195
15:26.934 --> 15:28.834
Then I'll be free.

196
15:31.134 --> 15:34.553
Since you've asked, do you have a plan?

197
15:36.654 --> 15:41.613
I do, but I can promise you nothing.

198
15:41.613 --> 15:44.228
It's worth trying.

199
15:44.228 --> 15:45.553
Tell me.

200
15:49.414 --> 15:51.254
For this plan to succeed,

201
15:51.254 --> 15:55.754
we need the right time, the right place, and the right people.

202
15:57.134 --> 15:58.573
Let us begin with the people.

203
15:58.573 --> 16:00.294
You always dress in finery,

204
16:00.294 --> 16:02.853
with mink furs, a jeweled saddle, and servants all around you.

205
16:02.853 --> 16:08.213
But Chancellor Liu shuns the wealthy and favors scholars of humble birth.

206
16:08.213 --> 16:12.153
Dressed like that, you are courting the wrong man.

207
16:14.254 --> 16:16.014
I'll get changed then.

208
16:16.014 --> 16:17.134
Exactly.

209
16:17.134 --> 16:21.983
Put aside those silks and don a plain hemp robe.

210
16:21.983 --> 16:25.093
Have you seen how scholars at the Imperial Academy dress?

211
16:25.093 --> 16:27.813
The more you resemble them, the better.

212
16:27.813 --> 16:31.634
That is the sort of attire learned elders prefer.

213
16:32.654 --> 16:33.854
Fine.

214
16:35.254 --> 16:36.594
Now, the place.

215
16:37.294 --> 16:38.960
No matter how noble your family,

216
16:38.960 --> 16:42.040
once you enter the Liu residence, you are in his domain.

217
16:42.040 --> 16:45.645
The residence has many gates to pass. Whether he sees you is entirely up to him.

218
16:49.654 --> 16:51.114
I see.

219
16:51.853 --> 16:54.254
I can't keep being turned away at his door.

220
16:54.254 --> 16:55.733
I'll have to intercept him outside.

221
16:55.733 --> 16:57.174
Precisely.

222
16:57.174 --> 16:59.534
Yu, you're truly brilliant!

223
16:59.534 --> 17:01.634
What of the timing? Tell me!

224
17:02.534 --> 17:04.553
As for the timing...

225
17:06.134 --> 17:09.574
Yu, promise me you'll keep this secret.

226
17:09.574 --> 17:12.161
Don't tell anyone you heard it from me.

227
17:12.161 --> 17:13.280
Don't worry.

228
17:13.280 --> 17:16.463
I, Yu Xian Yao, always keep my word.

229
17:20.773 --> 17:23.094
I heard from some colleagues today

230
17:23.094 --> 17:28.013
that Chancellor Liu will take tea at Huanghua Creek tomorrow morning.

231
17:28.013 --> 17:30.433
They're debating whether to call on him.

232
17:31.080 --> 17:33.280
Huanghua Creek?

233
17:35.600 --> 17:38.038
There is no shelter by the creek,

234
17:39.092 --> 17:40.953
nor any walls beyond the city.

235
17:41.614 --> 17:43.354
He won't be able to avoid me.

236
17:46.293 --> 17:48.574
Tomorrow is the right time.

237
17:48.574 --> 17:50.383
And Huanghua Creek is the right place.

238
17:50.383 --> 17:53.374
Yu, change your clothes and leave your attendants behind.

239
17:53.374 --> 17:55.400
Go dressed as a scholar out for a stroll.

240
17:55.400 --> 17:59.880
Once you approach and he sees you, he can hardly refuse.

241
17:59.880 --> 18:03.094
Then you'll have fulfilled your father's charge,

242
18:03.094 --> 18:05.334
and be free of this burden.

243
18:05.334 --> 18:09.960
If Chancellor Liu doesn't appear, you'll have made one wasted trip.

244
18:09.960 --> 18:12.000
Just consider it a leisurely stroll.

245
18:13.213 --> 18:16.920
Yan, you truly treat me as kin.

246
18:16.920 --> 18:18.973
Yu, don't mention it.

247
18:18.973 --> 18:21.973
I cannot vouch for its success.

248
18:21.973 --> 18:24.174
If it fails, don't blame me.

249
18:24.174 --> 18:26.493
How could I? I can't thank you enough.

250
18:26.493 --> 18:28.773
Let's go. Let me treat you to a meal at Cuiyun Tower.

251
18:28.773 --> 18:30.473
You're too kind, Yu.

252
18:33.253 --> 18:35.414
We should find you a plain linen robe first.

253
18:35.414 --> 18:36.713
No hurry, no hurry.

254
18:37.334 --> 18:38.640
- Hurry, hurry! - Make way!

255
18:38.640 --> 18:40.568
[Wangchun Tavern]

256
18:42.080 --> 18:43.293
- Quickly! - What's happening?

257
18:43.293 --> 18:45.905
This, this...

258
18:48.654 --> 18:50.854
Officer, forgive my poor welcome.

259
18:50.854 --> 18:53.013
May I ask which honored guest has arrived?

260
18:53.013 --> 18:57.233
Danyang Princess has come to sample your fare.

261
19:02.053 --> 19:05.360
Your Highness! Forgive me for not welcoming you sooner.

262
19:05.360 --> 19:06.760
Please, come in.

263
19:08.253 --> 19:11.233
Why is this place full of these foul-smelling men?

264
19:12.894 --> 19:15.614
Rest assured, Your Highness. They are all regular patrons.

265
19:15.614 --> 19:17.334
None are men of ill repute.

266
19:17.334 --> 19:19.493
How many heads do you have to guarantee that?

267
19:20.320 --> 19:22.334
I only have one head, Your Highness.

268
19:22.334 --> 19:23.374
Forgive me, Your Highness.

269
19:23.374 --> 19:25.094
I am at your command.

270
19:25.094 --> 19:26.693
Drive them all out.

271
19:26.693 --> 19:30.473
Her Highness will pay for their meals.

272
19:31.293 --> 19:35.213
You have until one incense stick burns down to clear them all out.

273
19:35.213 --> 19:38.114
Otherwise, I'll tear this wretched shop down.

274
19:39.195 --> 19:40.394
Yes, Your Highness.

275
19:43.533 --> 19:47.973
- Out, out, out! - Out, out, out!

276
19:55.053 --> 19:56.514
What did I tell you?

277
19:57.334 --> 19:59.053
Just report me to the authorities.

278
19:59.053 --> 20:00.654
What can they do to me?

279
20:00.654 --> 20:03.973
I'm still waiting for them to arrest me.

280
20:03.973 --> 20:06.554
Not a soul has shown up.

281
20:08.654 --> 20:13.393
Never mind crippling him. Even if I killed him, so what?

282
20:14.414 --> 20:16.356
Fill it up.

283
20:21.094 --> 20:22.934
What's going on?

284
20:22.934 --> 20:24.094
Sir, please calm down.

285
20:24.094 --> 20:25.934
Danyang Princess has arrived suddenly.

286
20:25.934 --> 20:29.533
She said the guests were too rowdy... and ordered us to clear the place.

287
20:29.533 --> 20:30.733
Gentlemen...

288
20:33.533 --> 20:34.854
Sit down.

289
20:34.854 --> 20:36.654
What are you panicking for?

290
20:36.654 --> 20:39.120
Let me tell you why you're all unsuccessful.

291
20:39.120 --> 20:41.200
It's because you're cowards.

292
20:42.733 --> 20:44.000
Keep eating and drinking.

293
20:44.000 --> 20:46.720
I'll go and greet Danyang Princess.

294
20:47.894 --> 20:50.854
Zhang, do you know Danyang Princess?

295
20:50.854 --> 20:54.453
I don't know her, and she doesn't know me.

296
20:54.453 --> 20:57.253
But she must know my father.

297
20:57.253 --> 21:00.960
Surely she won't deny him this favor.

298
21:13.693 --> 21:16.213
Stop there. Who are you?

299
21:17.453 --> 21:20.013
How many lives do you have to dare speak to me like that?

300
21:20.013 --> 21:23.360
Did you ask your mistress inside before stopping me?

301
21:23.360 --> 21:24.920
Who is outside?

302
21:26.854 --> 21:29.134
Your Highness, I am Zhang Jun.

303
21:29.134 --> 21:30.953
Who is Zhang Jun?

304
21:31.693 --> 21:34.044
My father is the Minister of Revenue, Zhang Cheng.

305
21:47.134 --> 21:49.153
So you're Young Master Zhang.

306
21:49.981 --> 21:53.074
Your name sounded familiar just now, but I couldn't place it at first.

307
21:54.414 --> 21:55.794
Greetings, Your Highness.

308
21:56.496 --> 21:58.290
What is the matter?

309
21:58.290 --> 21:59.374
It is nothing serious.

310
21:59.374 --> 22:03.915
I was drinking with friends next door when I heard the shopkeeper driving people out.

311
22:03.915 --> 22:07.574
So I took the liberty of coming to discuss it with you.

312
22:07.574 --> 22:09.960
What is there to discuss?

313
22:09.960 --> 22:12.894
I only wanted to clear out those commoners.

314
22:12.894 --> 22:16.433
Surely I wouldn't have you chased away too.

315
22:17.898 --> 22:19.453
Thank you, Your Highness.

316
22:19.453 --> 22:22.040
If there is nothing else, I will not disturb you any further.

317
22:22.040 --> 22:23.253
I shall take my leave.

318
22:23.253 --> 22:24.693
Wait.

319
22:24.693 --> 22:26.080
Drinking alone is dull.

320
22:26.080 --> 22:28.814
Why not stay, Young Master Zhang?

321
22:28.814 --> 22:32.614
Stay and share a drink with me. What do you say?

322
22:32.614 --> 22:34.680
Your Highness... You...

323
22:34.680 --> 22:38.680
You... You honor me too much.

324
22:40.094 --> 22:41.400
Fang Tong.

325
22:41.400 --> 22:43.894
Prepare another place setting for Young Master Zhang.

326
22:43.894 --> 22:45.374
Yes.

327
22:45.374 --> 22:47.074
Your Highness, please wait a moment.

328
22:47.973 --> 22:50.374
You there.

329
22:50.374 --> 22:52.374
Go tell the others.

330
22:52.374 --> 22:56.493
Tell them that Her Highness and I have become fast friends.

331
22:56.493 --> 22:58.094
I won't be returning to join them.

332
22:58.094 --> 23:00.533
Tell them to finish their meal and charge it to my account.

333
23:00.533 --> 23:01.753
Understand?

334
23:02.482 --> 23:03.720
Yes.

335
23:03.720 --> 23:04.840
Go.

336
23:36.293 --> 23:38.393
That's him. Seize him!

337
23:39.894 --> 23:41.920
What are you doing? Don't move!

338
23:41.920 --> 23:44.134
Who are you? This is the Imperial Academy!

339
23:44.134 --> 23:45.673
- Don't move! - Let go!

340
23:47.934 --> 23:49.153
What are you doing?

341
23:54.090 --> 23:56.200
- Looks about right. - What do you mean by "right"?

342
23:56.200 --> 23:58.213
- Strip him. - Understood!

343
23:58.213 --> 23:59.733
Take off everything.

344
23:59.733 --> 24:03.520
His robe, trousers, and shoes. Everything!

345
24:03.520 --> 24:04.654
Let go of me!

346
24:04.654 --> 24:05.854
Let go!

347
24:06.654 --> 24:09.376
How do I look? Do I have that air about me?

348
24:10.053 --> 24:13.400
Now you look truly dashing.

349
24:13.400 --> 24:15.680
Don't I always?

350
24:15.680 --> 24:16.899
What a foolish tongue I have.

351
24:16.899 --> 24:19.814
Of course you always do!

352
24:19.814 --> 24:22.934
But what sort of air do you mean?

353
24:22.934 --> 24:25.574
The scholarly sort.

354
24:25.574 --> 24:28.440
That same shabby, bookish look. Do I have it?

355
24:28.440 --> 24:30.320
- Who talks like that? - Who are you calling that?

356
24:31.560 --> 24:32.814
- Yes, yes, yes! - Yes, yes, yes!

357
24:32.814 --> 24:34.673
- You certainly do! - You certainly do!

358
24:41.560 --> 24:46.834
- What a braggart. - Keep your distance from him henceforth.

359
24:49.693 --> 24:50.776
Cheers!

360
24:51.414 --> 24:55.577
I never expected you could hold your liquor so well.

361
24:55.577 --> 24:58.894
I never knew that, among the ladies of Sheng'an,

362
24:58.894 --> 25:02.233
you were the boldest of all, Your Highness.

363
25:07.973 --> 25:11.533
I seldom leave my residence.

364
25:11.533 --> 25:16.372
Have you heard any interesting news from Sheng'an lately?

365
25:17.293 --> 25:20.334
Your Highness, you're putting me on the spot.

366
25:20.334 --> 25:22.013
I stay at home all day.

367
25:22.013 --> 25:24.094
I either study or practice martial arts.

368
25:24.094 --> 25:25.934
I hardly ever go out.

369
25:25.934 --> 25:27.673
I really haven't heard anything.

370
25:30.053 --> 25:33.053
Fang Tong, have you heard any news?

371
25:33.053 --> 25:34.773
Tell us.

372
25:34.773 --> 25:35.914
Go on.

373
25:37.453 --> 25:38.973
Your Highness,

374
25:38.973 --> 25:42.211
there has indeed been an unusual occurrence recently.

375
25:42.211 --> 25:44.773
It is said that

376
25:44.773 --> 25:49.013
an auspicious sign has appeared at Huanghua Creek.

377
25:49.013 --> 25:50.200
What auspicious sign?

378
25:50.200 --> 25:53.520
I heard someone saw it a few days ago.

379
25:53.520 --> 25:58.654
Each morning, a white pheasant appears by Huanghua Creek.

380
25:58.654 --> 26:01.433
The white pheasant is pure white from head to tail.

381
26:02.493 --> 26:04.624
That is indeed an auspicious sign.

382
26:06.574 --> 26:09.533
Wait... Huanghua Creek?

383
26:09.533 --> 26:11.894
I often hunt there.

384
26:11.894 --> 26:13.673
Where exactly by the creek?

385
26:14.950 --> 26:20.493
They say there is a thatched pavilion upstream at Huanghua Creek.

386
26:20.493 --> 26:24.939
The white pheasant often appears near that pavilion.

387
26:28.013 --> 26:29.874
What a pity.

388
26:30.773 --> 26:32.894
I'm just a frail woman.

389
26:32.894 --> 26:35.053
I can neither draw a bow nor ride a horse.

390
26:35.053 --> 26:38.377
I can't catch the auspicious sign, even if it is right before me.

391
26:39.693 --> 26:41.193
What a shame.

392
26:43.293 --> 26:44.834
Anything else?

393
26:45.414 --> 26:47.000
Yes.

394
26:47.000 --> 26:52.280
They say Cuiyun Tower has a new troupe of Hu dancers.

395
26:52.280 --> 26:53.973
A white pheasant at Huanghua Creek...

396
26:53.973 --> 26:59.293
If I hunt it and take its feathers, Father can present them to Lord Yu...

397
26:59.293 --> 27:01.533
They can even play the pipa.

398
27:01.533 --> 27:03.854
They are good at both singing and dancing.

399
27:03.854 --> 27:05.054
This...

400
27:07.600 --> 27:09.773
Come, come!

401
27:09.773 --> 27:12.063
Pour some wine for Young Master Zhang.

402
27:12.063 --> 27:15.405
Thank you. Forgive my rudeness at the door earlier.

403
27:16.414 --> 27:17.614
Cheers, Your Highness.

404
27:23.919 --> 27:25.127
[Wangchun Tavern]

405
27:32.600 --> 27:34.533
- Fang Tong. - What are your orders, Your Highness?

406
27:34.533 --> 27:36.493
Go find Yang Si.

407
27:36.493 --> 27:41.480
Ask if he'd like to join me for an outing tomorrow.

408
27:41.480 --> 27:42.640
Yes, Your Highness.

409
28:18.013 --> 28:19.634
Master, we've arrived.

410
28:34.693 --> 28:36.414
Don't follow me any farther.

411
28:36.414 --> 28:40.493
The old man can't stand people like you putting on airs.

412
28:40.493 --> 28:42.274
- Yes. - Yes.

413
28:48.854 --> 28:50.959
Go see if I hit anything.

414
28:54.360 --> 28:55.496
Master.

415
28:55.496 --> 28:58.233
- It's a wild rabbit. It ran away. - A wild rabbit?

416
28:58.814 --> 29:01.400
A mere rabbit doesn't deserve my arrow.

417
29:01.400 --> 29:03.120
Come on. Let's keep looking.

418
29:38.496 --> 29:39.590
Yan.

419
29:39.590 --> 29:41.183
What are you looking at?

420
29:42.507 --> 29:43.773
The weather is perfect.

421
29:43.773 --> 29:47.253
It's a fine day for hunting.

422
29:47.253 --> 29:48.786
You know how to hunt?

423
29:50.854 --> 29:52.054
I don't.

424
29:57.293 --> 29:59.453
Your Highness, I got it.

425
29:59.453 --> 30:01.745
He has left a trail of arrows.

426
30:05.253 --> 30:07.680
I'm running all over for him,

427
30:07.680 --> 30:10.360
while he works in peace at the Institute of Literary Studies.

428
30:10.934 --> 30:12.473
He's quite at leisure.

429
30:13.316 --> 30:14.634
Indeed.

430
30:21.053 --> 30:24.574
Yan Shang laid his trap perfectly.

431
30:24.574 --> 30:25.774
Let me do it.

432
30:30.693 --> 30:36.342
If the son must pay for the father's sins, a hundred deaths would not suffice.

433
30:45.973 --> 30:47.913
My backside!

434
30:51.080 --> 30:53.120
Where did that white pheasant go?

435
30:53.120 --> 30:55.437
White pheasant, where have you flown off to?

436
31:16.466 --> 31:18.320
Something's moving. Go check it out.

437
31:18.320 --> 31:19.480
Yes.

438
31:26.493 --> 31:28.760
Master, something's happened!

439
31:31.800 --> 31:34.493
What is it? Stop shouting.

440
31:34.493 --> 31:36.040
You'll never achieve anything great.

441
31:36.040 --> 31:38.040
I think... I think you shot someone.

442
31:43.334 --> 31:45.274
Why are you panicking?

443
31:45.973 --> 31:47.173
You!

444
31:47.920 --> 31:50.120
Go see if he's still breathing.

445
31:54.253 --> 31:55.414
Master, he's not dead.

446
31:55.414 --> 31:57.034
He's still breathing.

447
32:00.570 --> 32:02.574
Then make sure he stops breathing.

448
32:02.574 --> 32:04.493
Master, he's still alive!

449
32:04.493 --> 32:07.773
So young, yet so vicious.

450
32:07.773 --> 32:10.213
No wonder Her Highness asked me to keep watch here.

451
32:10.213 --> 32:11.413
What are you waiting for?

452
32:13.000 --> 32:14.720
If he wakes up, will you take care of him?

453
32:15.693 --> 32:17.080
Listen to me.

454
32:17.080 --> 32:21.120
Once he finds out I shot that arrow,

455
32:21.120 --> 32:22.493
he'll report me to the authorities.

456
32:22.493 --> 32:24.733
That would bring my father a great deal of trouble.

457
32:24.733 --> 32:25.933
I...

458
32:26.880 --> 32:30.200
Hurry. Dig a hole and bury him.

459
32:30.200 --> 32:31.320
Yes.

460
32:36.693 --> 32:39.174
Yao, have you been waiting long?

461
32:39.174 --> 32:40.693
Not at all.

462
32:40.693 --> 32:43.000
I was enjoying the scenery. I had time to spare.

463
32:43.000 --> 32:44.012
That mouth of yours...

464
32:44.012 --> 32:46.600
You've never had a kind word to say since we were children.

465
32:46.600 --> 32:48.359
Fortunately, I'm used to it.

466
32:48.359 --> 32:50.758
- Let's go. - Wait for Fang Tong.

467
32:50.758 --> 32:52.439
He went ahead to scout the way.

468
32:52.439 --> 32:53.840
He'll be back in a moment.

469
32:53.840 --> 32:55.414
Is he coming too?

470
32:55.414 --> 32:57.053
You can go back if you're unwilling.

471
32:57.053 --> 32:58.713
Who said I was unwilling?

472
33:00.522 --> 33:03.400
The last time we left the city together was when we were children.

473
33:03.400 --> 33:07.504
I remember you had a little bow and were always trying to shoot me in the backside.

474
33:10.023 --> 33:11.574
You talk too much.

475
33:11.574 --> 33:13.354
Why don't you return to the Dali Court?

476
33:15.094 --> 33:16.294
Your Highness.

477
33:17.414 --> 33:18.614
Well?

478
33:18.614 --> 33:20.080
Did you find a scenic spot?

479
33:20.080 --> 33:22.015
There's a reed marsh at Huanghua Creek.

480
33:22.015 --> 33:25.695
The scenery there is quite lovely.

481
33:25.695 --> 33:26.874
Then let's go.

482
33:38.760 --> 33:39.840
Wait.

483
33:40.827 --> 33:42.214
I think someone's over there.

484
33:48.122 --> 33:49.492
Hurry up!

485
33:49.492 --> 33:51.320
I'm not trying to rush you, but it took you ages to dig the hole.

486
33:51.320 --> 33:53.080
Why are you so slow at burying him?

487
33:53.840 --> 33:55.134
Look at the time!

488
33:55.134 --> 33:58.125
If I don't get back soon, my father will come looking for me.

489
33:58.125 --> 34:01.680
That man is Zhang Jun, son of Zhang Cheng, the Minister of Revenue.

490
34:01.680 --> 34:03.373
What are they doing?

491
34:06.814 --> 34:09.313
Hurry up! Where's all that energy you have at mealtimes?

492
34:12.493 --> 34:14.894
Are they committing murder?

493
34:14.894 --> 34:16.613
Let's go. We shouldn't get involved.

494
34:16.613 --> 34:19.000
No. Yao, let Fang Tong take you back.

495
34:19.000 --> 34:20.010
I must save him.

496
34:20.010 --> 34:22.520
Then be careful. Don't take unnecessary risks.

497
34:22.520 --> 34:23.760
Don't worry.

498
34:24.493 --> 34:26.894
Whatever happens today, I'll take full responsibility.

499
34:26.894 --> 34:29.320
I won't let you be implicated.

500
34:29.320 --> 34:31.853
I'll pretend you weren't here today.

501
34:39.814 --> 34:41.894
Bury him! Put your back into it!

502
34:41.894 --> 34:43.013
Dig a hole, toss in some dirt...

503
34:43.013 --> 34:44.800
You can't even manage that!

504
34:44.800 --> 34:46.640
I am Yang Si, an official of the Dali Court!

505
34:46.640 --> 34:49.576
- Who dares to treat human life so lightly? - Go! Go! Run!

506
34:53.160 --> 34:54.440
I thought there'd be a fierce fight.

507
34:54.440 --> 34:56.160
I can't believe they fled without a fight.

508
34:57.720 --> 34:59.920
I should have let Yao stay.

509
34:59.920 --> 35:01.172
She would've enjoyed the spectacle.

510
35:38.680 --> 35:39.734
Who...

511
35:39.734 --> 35:41.093
Who are...

512
35:41.093 --> 35:42.382
Who are you?

513
35:43.089 --> 35:45.093
Where am I?

514
35:45.093 --> 35:47.214
This is the Dali Court.

515
35:47.214 --> 35:49.013
I am Yang Si, an official here.

516
35:49.013 --> 35:50.873
Sir, you were shot by a stray arrow.

517
35:52.093 --> 35:54.573
It hurts! It hurts so much!

518
35:54.573 --> 35:55.880
Which blind fool did this?

519
35:55.880 --> 35:57.734
When I find him, I'll make him wish he were dead!

520
35:57.734 --> 36:00.053
It hurts! What are you doing?

521
36:00.053 --> 36:02.214
Where did this quack come from?

522
36:02.214 --> 36:05.294
We don't have physicians at the Dali Court. This is a coroner.

523
36:05.294 --> 36:06.453
What?

524
36:06.453 --> 36:07.734
Your backside is bleeding.

525
36:07.734 --> 36:08.994
Apply some medicine.

526
36:15.133 --> 36:18.000
Tiger Might General has arrived!

527
36:18.000 --> 36:19.240
Tiger Might General?

528
36:21.093 --> 36:22.514
This is the Dali Court.

529
36:42.178 --> 36:44.434
Lord Yu has arrived!

530
36:56.214 --> 36:58.523
I am Yang Si, an official of the Dali Court.

531
37:06.294 --> 37:07.873
He's out of danger for now.

532
37:08.854 --> 37:09.934
Thank you, Dr. Gao.

533
37:09.934 --> 37:11.400
I shall take my leave.

534
37:11.400 --> 37:12.702
No need to see me out.

535
37:21.334 --> 37:23.836
You said your name was Yang...

536
37:25.336 --> 37:28.394
I am Yang Si, an official of the Dali Court.

537
37:29.214 --> 37:30.414
Go on.

538
37:32.774 --> 37:33.960
Rest assured, Lord Yu.

539
37:33.960 --> 37:35.520
This case should be easy to solve.

540
37:36.720 --> 37:38.636
As you can see, Lord Yu,

541
37:38.636 --> 37:40.934
your son's nose and ears are caked with dirt.

542
37:40.934 --> 37:44.576
When he was found, the culprit was trying to bury him alive.

543
37:44.576 --> 37:45.733
Where is the culprit?

544
37:48.214 --> 37:51.390
I failed in my duty. I couldn't capture him alive.

545
37:52.214 --> 37:56.374
However, the arrow the culprit left in your son's body has already been removed.

546
37:56.374 --> 37:57.533
It serves as evidence.

547
37:57.533 --> 37:58.699
Lord Yu.

548
38:02.734 --> 38:07.634
From what I can tell, someone was hunting when the arrow struck your son.

549
38:08.414 --> 38:11.313
Rather than being intentional, it was more likely an accident.

550
38:11.880 --> 38:15.587
Whether it was accidental or intentional remains to be determined.

551
38:19.012 --> 38:20.198
Go on.

552
38:23.176 --> 38:24.854
The culprit is utterly depraved.

553
38:24.854 --> 38:27.193
He even tried to bury your son alive in a pit.

554
38:28.040 --> 38:30.160
He clearly meant to destroy the evidence and the body.

555
38:31.533 --> 38:36.793
You said someone saw the culprit

556
38:38.720 --> 38:41.093
trying to bury Xian Yao alive.

557
38:41.093 --> 38:44.954
Did that person see the culprit's face clearly?

558
38:46.493 --> 38:47.793
That was me.

559
38:49.573 --> 38:50.651
I saw him.

560
38:50.651 --> 38:53.320
It was Zhang Jun, son of Zhang Cheng, the Minister of Revenue.

561
38:53.320 --> 38:54.760
I've already sent men to arrest him.

562
38:56.013 --> 38:57.402
Thank you, General.

563
38:57.989 --> 38:59.173
Of course.

564
39:03.400 --> 39:06.400
As for this matter, we'll trouble you no further, Officer Yang.

565
39:26.093 --> 39:27.240
Thank you.

566
39:27.240 --> 39:28.440
Thank you.

567
39:34.320 --> 39:37.000
My son is here, isn't he?

568
39:50.973 --> 39:52.774
Lord Yu.

569
39:52.774 --> 39:54.200
Lord Yu, please hear me.

570
39:54.200 --> 39:56.000
I have failed to discipline my son.

571
39:56.000 --> 39:57.920
He deserves to die.

572
39:57.920 --> 40:01.774
When that little beast comes out, I'll break his legs myself.

573
40:06.093 --> 40:07.128
There is no need.

574
40:07.128 --> 40:08.694
There is.

575
40:08.694 --> 40:10.374
There is.

576
40:10.374 --> 40:11.673
Lord Zhang.

577
40:14.496 --> 40:18.973
Yintaimen has investigated this case.

578
40:18.973 --> 40:20.673
Your son, Zhang Jun,

579
40:21.920 --> 40:28.190
did indeed wound Yu Xian Yao by accident while out hunting.

580
40:28.934 --> 40:30.514
He did not do so intentionally.

581
40:33.053 --> 40:34.394
However,

582
40:35.590 --> 40:39.839
after finding Yu Xian Yao injured,

583
40:39.839 --> 40:42.512
your son not only failed to save him,

584
40:43.172 --> 40:48.176
but tried to bury him alive to destroy the evidence.

585
40:48.176 --> 40:49.600
Under the laws of Great Huai...

586
40:49.600 --> 40:51.800
Lord Yu! Lord Yu!

587
40:51.800 --> 40:53.533
My son is young and foolish.

588
40:53.533 --> 40:54.814
He acted out of confusion.

589
40:54.814 --> 40:57.480
He has committed a grave offense.

590
40:57.480 --> 41:01.396
I beg you, in your great magnanimity, to show him mercy.

591
41:01.396 --> 41:05.254
I have a little family wealth, and I am willing to surrender it all.

592
41:05.254 --> 41:07.753
I beg you to show mercy, Lord Yu!

593
41:24.694 --> 41:27.660
Lord Zhang, please rise.

594
41:29.415 --> 41:31.414
- Lord Yu... - Lord Zhang.

595
41:32.694 --> 41:34.709
Lord Zhang.

596
41:37.533 --> 41:39.514
I am a eunuch.

597
41:41.133 --> 41:43.353
I am a eunuch.

598
41:45.013 --> 41:47.034
I have no heirs of my own.

599
41:47.894 --> 41:55.313
I endured more than a decade of hardship to raise this adopted son to adulthood.

600
41:56.254 --> 42:02.825
Even I, whom you all call a vile eunuch,

601
42:03.610 --> 42:06.070
know that a child must be taught

602
42:06.070 --> 42:10.934
to obey the law and uphold virtue.

603
42:10.934 --> 42:13.120
Don't you understand this?

604
42:13.120 --> 42:14.133
I--

605
42:14.133 --> 42:15.854
You old fool!

606
42:15.854 --> 42:19.315
You old beast!

607
42:20.280 --> 42:22.280
You villain!

608
42:27.000 --> 42:28.396
Lord Yu!

609
42:29.533 --> 42:30.733
Lord Yu!

610
42:33.814 --> 42:35.374
Lord Yu!

611
42:35.374 --> 42:36.814
Lord Yu.

612
42:36.814 --> 42:38.493
My son was ignorant.

613
42:38.493 --> 42:40.493
He offended your son.

614
42:40.493 --> 42:43.600
He deserves a thousand deaths.

615
42:43.600 --> 42:48.774
But I am nearly seventy, and he is my only child.

616
42:48.774 --> 42:54.793
If anything happens to him, I cannot go on living.

617
42:55.734 --> 43:00.493
Lord Yu, let me atone for my son's sins.

618
43:00.493 --> 43:02.973
Spare his life!

619
43:02.973 --> 43:04.240
Lord Yu!

620
43:04.240 --> 43:06.053
Lord Yu, I beg you!

621
43:06.053 --> 43:10.074
Lord Yu, please! Lord Yu!

622
43:11.254 --> 43:12.454
Lord Yu!

623
43:13.254 --> 43:15.434
Spare his life!

624
43:16.694 --> 43:18.088
Lord Zhang.

625
43:19.172 --> 43:21.153
You are being foolish.

626
43:22.573 --> 43:27.084
When Yintaimen punishes a criminal, who would dare interfere?

627
43:27.973 --> 43:29.013
Lord Yu!

628
43:29.013 --> 43:30.573
Lord Yu!

629
43:30.573 --> 43:31.793
Lord Yu!

630
43:32.493 --> 43:34.374
Please, show mercy.

631
43:34.374 --> 43:36.533
Spare his life.

632
43:36.533 --> 43:37.973
Lord Yu!

633
43:37.973 --> 43:42.034
Have mercy, Lord Yu! Lord Yu!

634
43:50.093 --> 43:53.053
Roast a camel hump for me tonight.

635
43:53.053 --> 43:56.064
Char the hump a little.

636
43:56.064 --> 43:58.694
And prepare some chicken tail too.

637
43:58.694 --> 44:01.151
Make sure it's fatty.

638
44:01.151 --> 44:03.334
I need some nourishment. Understand?

639
44:03.334 --> 44:04.753
- Yes. - Yes.

640
44:10.694 --> 44:15.093
It hurts! My backside...

641
44:15.093 --> 44:16.453
How is he today?

642
44:16.453 --> 44:19.514
Lord Yu, the physician says his injuries aren't serious.

643
44:27.573 --> 44:30.320
My backside!

644
44:30.320 --> 44:33.734
It hurts so much! My backside...

645
44:33.734 --> 44:36.463
My backside!

646
44:38.052 --> 44:39.093
Enough.

647
44:39.093 --> 44:40.573
Does it really hurt that much?

648
44:40.573 --> 44:43.093
Father, it hurts terribly.

649
44:43.093 --> 44:44.939
I was almost shot to death.

650
44:44.939 --> 44:47.634
Of course it hurts! I was scared out of my wits.

651
44:49.000 --> 44:50.814
So now you know what pain is.

652
44:50.814 --> 44:52.360
What have I taught you?

653
44:52.360 --> 44:54.280
A man of standing must not risk his life.

654
44:54.280 --> 44:56.674
Why venture to such a remote place?

655
44:56.674 --> 45:00.400
But, Father, you told me to get close to Chancellor Liu.

656
45:00.400 --> 45:04.533
I heard he was going to Huanghua Creek to brew tea, so I went there.

657
45:04.533 --> 45:07.334
I hoped to meet him by chance.

658
45:07.334 --> 45:11.720
I even changed into scholarly robes and bought him a gift.

659
45:11.720 --> 45:13.320
Doesn't it hurt anymore?

660
45:14.060 --> 45:17.120
It does! Of course it does! It hurts terribly!

661
45:17.120 --> 45:18.774
Enough.

662
45:18.774 --> 45:20.533
Stop pretending.

663
45:20.533 --> 45:24.013
When have you ever acted so methodically before?

664
45:24.013 --> 45:25.763
Did someone put you up to this?

665
45:31.240 --> 45:36.056
[Next Episode Preview]

666
45:36.056 --> 45:38.774
I have one more favor to ask.

667
45:38.774 --> 45:42.983
I beg you to send me into the palace to become a servant, Your Highness.

668
45:44.573 --> 45:46.294
Well spoken, Liu Wen Ji.

669
45:46.294 --> 45:50.594
I had no intention of helping you, but you've changed my mind.
